{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05781","headline":"八月十五日象自江东止田园移庄庆会未几归汶上小弟幼妹尤嗟其别兼赋是诗三首 三 · 卢象","name":"八月十五日象自江东止田园移庄庆会未几归汶上小弟幼妹尤嗟其别兼赋是诗三首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"小弟更孩幼，归来不相识。\n同居虽渐惯，见人犹默默。\n宛作越人言，殊乡甘水食。\n别此最爲难，泪尽有余忆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢象","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}